\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Embedding-stage positional transformation}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{architecture}

\p{Using the dimensions of \ref{ftip-000L}, an
\newvocab{embedding-stage positional transformation} is a specified family of
position-dependent transformations
#{r_t:\mathbb R^d\to\mathbb R^d}, one for each
#{t\in\{1,\ldots,T\}}. Applied after the token embedding of
\ref{ftip-000M}, it produces the initial hidden vector
##{
X^{(0)}_t=r_t(E_{x_t}).
}
The family #{(r_t)_{t=1}^T} is part of the architecture, even when it has no
learned parameters.}
